  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  displayName: Quibbit
  description: "Quibbit are small, silky and cheerful creatures that bounce along
    cosmic lands. They leave behind glittering trails of light that emanates from
    the \u201Cjewels\u201D on their bodies, lighting up even the darkest corners
    of space. Though eye-catching, their gem-studded skin makes for good camouflage
    in the caves where they reside, helping them blend in perfectly with the shiny
    ores. \r"
  yOffset: 2
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 50037af8f3e51994b83cdae49bc38b7f, type: 3}
